msgid ""
"CPU targets only: the pass rewrites scalar-path atomic intrinsics into plain "
"BufferLoad/BufferStore RMW so that both CPU codegens (`c` and `llvm`) can "
"consume them. Tile-region atomics are lowered separately by the cpu."
"AtomicAdd/cpu.AtomicReduce impls inside LowerTileOp."
msgstr ""

