#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cpu/transform/index.rst:53
msgid ""
"CPU targets only; runs at the tail of the CPU pipeline (only inserted when "
"the ``tl.cpu_parallel`` pass config is enabled). Consumes the ``tl."
"cpu_grid_dim`` annotations added by LowerCPUKernelLaunch, converts the grid "
"loops to ForKind::kParallel (all dims on the ``c`` target for collapse(n); "
"the first non-unit dim on ``llvm``), and sinks function-scope allocations "
"whose uses all lie inside the parallel region into the parallel loop body "
"for per-worker privacy."
msgstr ""
